 17: /**
 18:  * Player combat and skill sounds, transcribed from the original client:
 19:  * swing by weapon (ZzzCharacter.cpp:1219-1233), pain screams (:1339-1349),
 20:  * death (:1477-1487), hit confirmation (:5183-5190), and skill casts keyed by
 21:  * the wire skill number (`ExecuteSkill` / `AttackEffect`
 22:  * ZzzCharacter.cpp:4280-5045, `ReceiveAttackSkill` WSclient.cpp:3880-4760).
 23:  * Monster voices are their own entry (`monsters.ts`).
 24:  *
 25:  * Driven by: `CombatSfxSystem` (swing / pain / death), `logic.ts` and
 26:  * `skillCastSystem` (skills, hits), through the selectors + `playCombat` /
 27:  * `playSkill`. Command-only: no per-frame state.
 28:  */
